    "https://jobs.buffalostate.edu": {
      "title": "Job Opportunities",
      "description": "Buffalo State University Applicant Portal | Home Skip to Main Content Job Opportunities at Buffalo State University Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQs Apply for Classified Job Directions, Maps, Parking Human Resources Benefits Welcome to the Buffalo State University employment portal. Buffalo State offers engaging and challenging work in a variety of positions to fit your career goals. Along with competitive salaries, benefits include health, dental and vision insurance, vacation and sick leave, holiday pay, retirements plans, tuition assistance, flexible spending accounts. Buffalo State University is committed to diversity in its staff, faculty, and student body, and invites all qualified people to apply, including minorities and women, veterans, and individuals with disabilities. Faculty and Professional Classified Graduate Assistant Part-Time Faculty About Buffalo State University Employment Benefits News and Events Background Investigation Statement Buffalo State University will perform pre-employment background checks on final applicants prior to all new appointments (part-time and full-time) for faculty, professional staff, classified staff and graduate assistants. Any verbal or written employment offer extended to an applicant is subject to a pre-employment background investigation. The college's Pre-Employment Background Screening Policy and forms are available at hr.buffalostate.edu/pre-employment-background-screening . Accommodation Requests Arrangements can be made if an applicant has a disability that requires an accommodation in completing the application form or in interviewing. Applicants are not required to note the presence of a disability on this application. Reasonable accommodation requests must be made in a timely manner to Jamie Warnes in the Human Resource Management Office at 716-878-4822 or warnesje@buffalostate.edu . New Users Use the site navigation to Search Jobs. You must create an account before applying. Review the Applicant Tutorial for guidance. Chrome and Firefox browsers function best with this site. Returning Users Applicants Log In with your username and password to: Apply to new jobs without re-entering information. Review the status of positions you've applied to. Human Resource Management Office Buffalo State University •  1300 Elmwood Avenue  •  Cleveland Hall 403 Buffalo, NY 14222  •  Phone: 716-878-3042 •  Fax: 716-878-3068 Website: hr.buffalostate.edu • E-mail: senecacl@buffalostate.edu Clery Statement Equal Employment Opportunity Statement Buffalo State Home To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
    }
